  "text_content": "Menu Student Files Classes Instructor Open submenu Reports Open submenu Set Class Schedule School Permits Close submenu Instructor Instructor Schedule Open submenu Instructor Reports Open submenu My Signatures Close submenu Instructor Schedule Booked Appointments Specify Hours Close submenu Instructor Reports Work Summary To Do Lists Close submenu Reports AQTR Registrations Ilan Preisler logout Self-Evaluation of In-Car Session Practical Session #5 Fertoukh, Adam 1. In the Learner's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Parking, double stop, turning (stay in line) 2. In the Instructor's view, what are the strengths and what are the weaknesses to be worked on at this stage of he practical training? Need to do mirror checks more frequently. Check blind spot more often. Needs more practice OEA. Need to improve lane change (checking the blind spot) Some problems controlling the car at some turns. Do not cross the intersection in yellow light !!! . Good but hesitant. Student Student Signature Fertoukh, Adam Dec 10, 2025 Instructor Instructor Signature Anatoli Touranski L-XXX Save",
